{"alias":"/schools/nutrition/programs/ffvp","title":"Fresh Fruit and Vegetable Program (FFVP)","changed":"2026-06-04T16:13:52+00:00","before":"<p align=\"left\"><img alt=\"FFVP Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f89a558f-2a44-4d3a-a993-2a8723400ebe\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/FFVP.png\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">The&nbsp;Fresh Fruit and Vegetable Program&nbsp;is one way to provide healthy food to elementary school children. The level of funds provided to any one school depends on the demographics of schools that are selected to participate in the program.&nbsp;Federal guidelines allow funding based on a range of $50 to $75.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>FFVP Brochure&nbsp;to promote at open houses, parent-teacher conferences, and other community events</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/-HFlt9zLpkg\">SY26&nbsp;FFVP Updates</a>&nbsp;(9/9/2025)</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a93b1b87-d2d8-4bfc-a046-929aefa3fc1a\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FY27 Fresh Fruits and Vegetables Program Awards - 6.2.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FY27%20Fresh%20Fruits%20and%20Vegetables%20Program%20Awards%20-%206.2.2026.pdf\">FY27&nbsp;FFVP Awards</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>FFVP Program Forms</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Budgeting Calculator&nbsp;(Adapted from Kansas State Department of Education)</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a4fdcac6-3e8a-480c-9832-27cfe81443f9\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Fresh Fruits &amp; Vegetables Program Equipment Request Form - 1.5.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Fresh%20Fruits%20%26%20Vegetables%20Program%20Equipment%20Request%20Form%20-%201.5.2026.pdf\">Equipment Request Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b6008be0-0666-4e8b-9ec4-becde33e10ff\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - OnSiteReviewFormFFVP - 11.22.2024_0.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20OnSiteReviewFormFFVP%20-%2011.22.2024_0.doc\">On-Site FFVP Review Form</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>FFVP Program Resources</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.fns.usda.gov/ffvp/fresh-fruits-and-vegetable-program-handbook-schools\">FFVP Handbook for Schools</a>&nbsp;link to USDA</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.fns.usda.gov/ffvp/fresh-fruit-and-vegetable-program\">FVP Resources</a>&nbsp;link to USDA; provides resources to help build successful programs</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cc9753e6-4e5f-491e-910c-b973d3f5a258\" filename=\"USDA FFVPFactSheet.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/USDA%20FFVPFactSheet.pdf\">USDA FFVP Fact Sheet</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e2f26616-6f61-4358-a207-9d26d4ca499b\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Editable Calendar Template - 7.29.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Editable%20Calendar%20Template%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">Editable FFVP Calendar Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"96849e7d-2924-4581-b279-034055eabf85\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Editable Fun Fact Sheet - 7.29.2025 pdf.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Editable%20Fun%20Fact%20Sheet%20-%207.29.2025%20pdf.pdf\">Editable FFVP Fun Fact Sheet</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e2e3761f-5fec-4d7c-a326-5e7103b090ca\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Informational Handout for Parents - 7.29.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Informational%20Handout%20for%20Parents%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Informational Handout for Parent</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"87174958-adec-4df2-b7b5-23295fa13aca\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Morning Announcement Examples - 7.29.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Morning%20Announcement%20Examples%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Morning Announcement Examples</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"fb40d6fe-4a9a-4e7e-959a-ae7e89d518d4\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Sample Fun Fact Sheet - 7.29.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Fun%20Fact%20Sheet%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Sample Fun Fact Sheet</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cb3a169d-afa9-4a9f-99ff-a3634c35d49f\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Sample Menu - 7.29.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Menu%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Sample Menu</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c5509d1a-34a5-4e52-ab21-c6f7b1aff619\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Sample Parent Letter - 7.29.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Parent%20Letter%20-%207.29.2025.docx\">FFVP Sample Parent Letter</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1907bfe4-f9bb-4c25-8ec5-c191b8631d9d\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Sample Teacher Letter - 7.29.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Teacher%20Letter%20-%207.29.2025.docx\">FFVP Sample Teacher Letter</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e25068e2-6a95-47b8-8afc-4ea5f39d4add\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - FFVP Word Searches - 7.29.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Word%20Searches%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Word Searches</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><strong>Fruit and Vegetable Fact Sheets</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"http://www.nj.gov/agriculture/divisions/fn/pdf/azfunfacts.pdf\">Fruits and Veggies From A to Z</a>&nbsp;(pdf) Developed by New Jersey Dept of Agriculture</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-bordered\" width=\"50%\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td width=\"189\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"41beebf3-379b-416e-bf73-1f4c4c8bfd4f\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Beets.pdf\" title=\"Beets\">Beets</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td width=\"185\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\">Persimmons&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"d41cf59e-0324-40dd-9692-ad18cde7b5db\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Blueberries.pdf\" title=\"Blueberries\">Blueberries</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b24068e2-33d6-4678-bda5-bb052cc9abb8\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Pumpkin.pdf\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"59612bcb-f888-4457-bbd1-300ce6c32f84\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Broccoli.pdf\" title=\"Broccoli\">Broccoli</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e1322f63-3a63-4ca3-a135-334980c7a2de\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Spinach.pdf\" title=\"Spinach\">Spinach</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c0646f4d-7670-40d7-aa84-ba3618507974\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Fresh%20Pineapple%202.pdf\" title=\"Fresh Pineapple\">Fresh Pineapple</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f41a2bd5-42ea-494c-bbbf-7f84a42a746d\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sweet%20Potato.pdf\" title=\"Sweet potato\">Sweet Potato</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\">Kale&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"bf261edb-3b4f-4c98-bc00-1c3578a44210\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Zucchini.pdf\" title=\"Zucchini\">Zucchini</a>&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"jumbotron jumbotronfluid text-align-center\"><em><a href=\"/doe/schools/nutrition/nondiscrimination\">Non-Discrimination Statement and Civil Rights Information</a></em>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Stephanie Stambach</strong><br />\r\nChild Nutrition Supervisor<br />\r\n<strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong><avayaelement class=\"contentWrapper\"><avayaelement callelement=\"+12072159437\" class=\"dcelink\" id=\"dceLink-1\" originaltext=\"207-215-9437\">207-215-9437</avayaelement></avayaelement><br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Stephanie.Stambach@maine.gov\">Stephanie.Stambach@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Programs - Child Nutrition</p>\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">The Fresh Fruit and Vegetable Program is one way to provide healthy food to elementary school children. The level of funds provided to any one school depends on the demographics of schools that are selected to participate in the program. Federal guidelines allow funding based on a range of $50 to $75.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>FFVP Brochure&nbsp;to promote at open houses, parent-teacher conferences, and other community events</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/-HFlt9zLpkg\">SY26&nbsp;FFVP Updates</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span>&nbsp;(9/9/2025)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FY27%20Fresh%20Fruits%20and%20Vegetables%20Program%20Awards%20-%206.2.2026.pdf\">FY27&nbsp;FFVP Awards</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>FFVP Program Forms</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Budgeting Calculator&nbsp;(Adapted from Kansas State Department of Education)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Fresh%20Fruits%20%26%20Vegetables%20Program%20Equipment%20Request%20Form%20-%201.5.2026.pdf\">Equipment Request Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20OnSiteReviewFormFFVP%20-%2011.22.2024_0.doc\">On-Site FFVP Review Form</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"ffvp-program-resources\"><h2>FFVP Program Resources</h2></div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.fns.usda.gov/ffvp/fresh-fruits-and-vegetable-program-handbook-schools\">FFVP Handbook for Schools</a>&nbsp;link to USDA</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"https://www.fns.usda.gov/ffvp/fresh-fruit-and-vegetable-program\">FVP Resources</a>&nbsp;Link to USDA; provides resources to help build successful programs</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/USDA%20FFVPFactSheet.pdf\">USDA FFVP Fact Sheet</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Editable%20Calendar%20Template%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">Editable FFVP Calendar Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Editable%20Fun%20Fact%20Sheet%20-%207.29.2025%20pdf.pdf\">Editable FFVP Fun Fact Sheet</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Informational%20Handout%20for%20Parents%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Informational Handout for Parent</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Morning%20Announcement%20Examples%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Morning Announcement Examples</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Fun%20Fact%20Sheet%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Sample Fun Fact Sheet</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Menu%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Sample Menu</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Parent%20Letter%20-%207.29.2025.docx\">FFVP Sample Parent Letter</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Sample%20Teacher%20Letter%20-%207.29.2025.docx\">FFVP Sample Teacher Letter</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20FFVP%20Word%20Searches%20-%207.29.2025.pdf\">FFVP Word Searches</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"fruit-and-vegetable-fact-sheets\"><h2>Fruit and Vegetable Fact Sheets</h2></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"http://www.nj.gov/agriculture/divisions/fn/pdf/azfunfacts.pdf\">Fruits and Veggies From A to Z</a> Developed by New Jersey Dept of Agriculture</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Beets.pdf\" title=\"Beets\">Beets</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\">Persimmons&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Blueberries.pdf\" title=\"Blueberries\">Blueberries</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Pumpkin.pdf\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Broccoli.pdf\" title=\"Broccoli\">Broccoli</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Spinach.pdf\" title=\"Spinach\">Spinach</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Fresh%20Pineapple%202.pdf\" title=\"Fresh Pineapple\">Fresh Pineapple</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sweet%20Potato.pdf\" title=\"Sweet potato\">Sweet Potato</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\">Kale&nbsp;(pdf)</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Zucchini.pdf\" title=\"Zucchini\">Zucchini</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"dc-note jumbotronfluid text-align-center\">\n<p class=\"doe-action\"><em><a href=\"/doe/schools/nutrition/nondiscrimination\">Non-Discrimination Statement and Civil Rights Information</a></em>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Stephanie Stambach</strong><br />\r\n<em>Child Nutrition Supervisor</em><br />\r\n<strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong>207-215-9437<br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Stephanie.Stambach@maine.gov\">Stephanie.Stambach@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["2 section headers — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"pseudo:ffvp-program-resources","on":true,"label":"Make a bold line a real heading","why":"\"FFVP Program Resources\" is a paragraph in bold type. It reads as a heading and is spaced like one, but it is not in the page's outline, a screen reader does not announce it, and the contents list cannot link to it.","value":"h2"},{"id":"pseudo:fruit-and-vegetable-fact-sheets","on":true,"label":"Make a bold line a real heading","why":"\"Fruit and Vegetable Fact Sheets\" is a paragraph in bold type. It reads as a heading and is spaced like one, but it is not in the page's outline, a screen reader does not announce it, and the contents list cannot link to it.","value":"h2"},{"id":"blockhead","on":true,"label":"Turn the headings into section headers","why":"2 headings are plain text where every other page uses a section header, so the page reads as one continuous wall instead of parts.","value":"2 sections"},{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"4 links on this page open a file — 3 Word, 1 Video — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"4 links"},{"id":"jumbotron","on":true,"label":"Jumbotron callouts become notes","why":"1 callout is built as a Bootstrap jumbotron, which the component list replaced with dc-note and which Bootstrap itself removed in version 5. Same content, the site's own callout.","value":"1 callout"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"1 list item opens with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"1 item"},{"id":"contacttitle","on":true,"label":"Set a job title the way the rest of the site does","why":"1 job title sits in plain text under the person's name, where 186 elsewhere on the site are in italics — so the same contact block is drawn two ways depending on the page, and the title runs into the name above it. The standard here is the site's own, not a preference: two thirds of these blocks already do it. No word changes.","value":"1 title"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"The Fresh Fruit and Vegetable Program is one way to provide healthy food to elementary school children. The level of funds provided to any one school depends on the demographics of schools that are selected to participate in the program. Federal guidelines allow funding based on a range of $50 to $75."},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"FFVP.png"},{"id":"descap","on":true,"label":"Start a description with a capital","why":"1 description begins with a small letter, because it used to run on from the link after a dash. The dash is gone and the link now sits above in its own face, so each description opens a line of its own. One character changes and only ever the first.","value":"1 description"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Programs - Child Nutrition\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /schools/nutrition/programs."}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 70","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 1","elements that are not HTML: 4","tables normalised to the house shape: 1","table cells released from fixed pixel widths: 2","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","images released from inline dimensions: 1","action links marked: 24","format labels chipped: 9"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/schools/nutrition/programs/ffvp","title":"Fresh Fruit and Vegetable Program (FFVP)","changed":"2026-06-04T16:1